  "scope": "Private fallible ShaperData caches, Unicode input/language, shape-plan storage, live paired glyph-buffer growth, AAT feature/event/active/current maps with nested chain/range flags, spilled OpenType match positions and stable Indic position sorting. AAT stable sorting uses paid indexed records; contextual and ligature SmallVec storage preserves four inline slots and native geometric targets, including recursive-substitution growth. Instrumented matching, position initialization/copy and lookup bookkeeping are prepaid. Observed Indic sorting pays actual indexed key/glyph records and heap-sort work, preserves stable ties, and commits only after the final copy payment; the default sort_by_key path is retained. Owned outputs retain no budget borrow. Default allocation paths and original shaping decisions/tables are retained. Observed buffer insertion sorting prepays comparisons, glyph copies and the shared cluster-merge scans; nonmonotone unsafe flags use a prepaid complete-range visit bound. Normalization and Myanmar stop after a cached refusal. Sorts add no scratch allocation. Other kernel scratch/work, other shaping paths, allocator overcapacity and whole-command simultaneous graphs remain outside this operation.",
